    {
      "fileName": "psi-development.json",
      "id": "HkbP5zbN2meRiP7w",
      "name": "Psi Development",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "HkbP5zbN2meRiP7w",
        "folder": "vSRvcWOl4kuKhLnp",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Psi Development",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "passive"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>You've found a new mental form. You gain another psi cantrip from your conscious mind: either the standard cantrip you didn't take with Psychic Dedication, or the unique surface psi cantrip. You gain the psychic benefits for this second psi cantrip. You gain the ability to amp your psi cantrips. If you don't have one, you gain a focus pool of 1 Focus Point, which you can use to amp your psi cantrips, and you can Refocus by meditating on your new powers.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 6
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": [
              {
                "value": "Psychic Dedication"
              }
            ]
          },
          "publication": {
            "license": "ORC",
            "remaster": true,
            "title": "Pathfinder Dark Archive (Remastered)"
          },
          "rules": [
            {
              "key": "ActiveEffectLike",
              "mode": "add",
              "path": "system.resources.focus.max",
              "priority": 10,
              "value": 1
            },
            {
              "adjustName": false,
              "choices": "flags.system.psychic.dedication.psiCantrips",
              "flag": "dedicationCantrip",
              "key": "ChoiceSet",
              "prompt": "PF2E.SpecificRule.Prompt.PsiCantrip",
              "rollOption": "selected-psi-cantrip"
            },
            {
              "itemType": "spell",
              "key": "ItemAlteration",
              "mode": "add",
              "predicate": [
                "feat:psychic-dedication",
                "spellcasting:tradition:occult",
                "item:slug:{item|flags.system.rulesSelections.dedicationCantrip}"
              ],
              "priority": 19,
              "property": "other-tags",
              "value": "psi-cantrip"
            },
            {
              "key": "RollOption",
              "label": "PF2E.SpecificRule.Psychic.Amp.Toggle",
              "option": "amp-spell",
              "placement": "spellcasting",
              "toggleable": true
            },
            {
              "itemType": "spell",
              "key": "ItemAlteration",
              "mode": "add",
              "predicate": [
                "amp-spell",
                "item:tag:psi-cantrip"
              ],
              "property": "other-tags",
              "value": "amped"
            },
            {
              "itemType": "spell",
              "key": "ItemAlteration",
              "mode": "add",
              "predicate": [
                "item:tag:amped"
              ],
              "property": "focus-point-cost",
              "value": 1
            }
          ],
          "traits": {
            "rarity": "common",
            "value": [
              "archetype"
            ]
          }
        },
        "type": "feat"
      },
      "level": 6,
      "category": "class"
    },
    {
      "fileName": "psychic-dedication.json",
      "id": "OW3W2vMARiojda7e",
      "name": "Psychic Dedication",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "OW3W2vMARiojda7e",
        "folder": "vSRvcWOl4kuKhLnp",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Psychic Dedication",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "passive"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>You feel something awaken within your mind. You become trained in Occultism; if you were already trained in Occultism, you become trained in a skill of your choice.</p>\n<p>You cast spells like a psychic and gain the Cast a Spell activity; as you don't have a subconscious mind class feature, your thoughtforms are simple intentions. Choose a conscious mind. You gain a spell repertoire with one standard psi cantrip of your choice from your conscious mind, which you cast as a psi cantrip.</p>\n<p>You gain the normal benefits for this psi cantrip, but not any other benefits from the conscious mind. You're trained in the spell attack modifier and spell DC statistics. Your key spellcasting attribute for psychic archetype spells is the attribute you used to qualify for the archetype, and they are occult psychic spells.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.journals.JournalEntry.vx5FGEG34AxI2dow.JournalEntryPage.ygzv72IJNmjh0SPB]{Psychic}</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 2
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": [
              {
                "value": "Intelligence +2 or Charisma +2"
              }
            ]
          },
          "publication": {
            "license": "ORC",
            "remaster": true,
            "title": "Pathfinder Dark Archive (Remastered)"
          },
          "rules": [
            {
              "key": "ActiveEffectLike",
              "mode": "upgrade",
              "path": "system.skills.occultism.rank",
              "value": 1
            },
            {
              "adjustName": false,
              "choices": {
                "filter": [
                  "item:tag:psychic-conscious-mind",
                  {
                    "not": "item:tag:class-archetype"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "flag": "consciousMind",
              "key": "ChoiceSet",
              "prompt": "PF2E.SpecificRule.Prompt.ConsciousMind"
            },
            {
              "key": "GrantItem",
              "uuid": "{item|flags.system.rulesSelections.consciousMind}"
            }
          ],
          "subfeatures": {
            "proficiencies": {
              "spellcasting": {
                "rank": 1
              }
            }
          },
          "traits": {
            "otherTags": [
              "spellcasting-multiclass-archetype"
            ],
            "rarity": "common",
            "value": [
              "archetype",
              "dedication",
              "multiclass"
            ]
          }
        },
        "type": "feat"
      },
      "level": 2,
      "category": "class"
    }
  ]
